WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Ryu connects the close medium-punch sequence against Ken.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.150
Ryu glows gold as OD High Blade Kick connects.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.850
Ken is airborne after the OD launcher while Ryu prepares the juggle.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.550
Ryu begins the rising Shoryuken beneath Ken.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.000
Ryu rises with Ken during the final Shoryuken.
